bad port REQUEST ERR_BLOCKED_PORT: fetch does not connect to port 6000: browsers and node block it too
ftp REQUEST ERR_UNSUPPORTED_SCHEME: fetch cannot get ftp://example.com/: only http:, https: and data: work
no url REQUEST ERR_INVALID_URL: fetch cannot parse "not a url" as a URL
credentials REQUEST ERR_CREDENTIALS_IN_URL: the URL http://user:pw@localhost/ has a user name or a password; send them in the authorization header instead
no host NETWORK ENOTFOUND: could not find the address of no-such-host.invalid: no such name in DNS
data 200 hello world
base64 200 hi
get with body REQUEST ERR_BODY_WITH_GET: a GET request cannot have a body: use POST, or drop the body
bad method REQUEST ERR_INVALID_METHOD: fetch does not send TRACE requests
no duplex REQUEST ERR_DUPLEX_REQUIRED: a request whose body is a stream needs duplex: "half"
small body 200 10 bytes
large body 413 
large stream 413 
